 builds don’t share Go build-cache entries with plain builds.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 12 out of 12 changed files in this pull request and generated 2 comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| tool/util/toolexec_dropin_test.go | Unit tests for work-dir discovery and GOFLAGS stripping behavior. |\r\n| tool/util/shared.go | Adds `DiscoverWorkDir` and the `OTELC_NESTED_TOOLEXEC` env marker constant. |\r\n| tool/util/go.go | Implements GOFLAGS tokenization and stripping of `-toolexec`. |\r\n| tool/internal/instrument/toolexec.go | Adds tool-version probing rewrite, nested gating, and nested toolexec enablement. |\r\n| tool/internal/instrument/toolexec_exec_test.go | Tests toolexec exec plumbing and nested gating behavior. |\r\n| tool/internal/instrument/tool_version_test.go | Tests tool-version marker formatting and nested toolexec env setup. |\r\n| tool/internal/instrument/match.go | Improves missing `matched.json` error with actionable guidance. |\r\n| tool/internal/instrument/instrument_test.go | Updates toolexec invocation for new `nested` parameter. |\r\n| tool/cmd/otelc/main.go | Strips `-toolexec` from GOFLAGS at startup; discovers work dir for bare toolexec mode. |\r\n| tool/cmd/otelc/cmd_toolexec.go | Enables nested toolexec and passes nested flag into instrumentation layer. |\r\n| test/integration/toolexec_goflags_test.go | New integration coverage for GOFLAGS drop-in build flow and caching behavior. |\r\n| docs/getting-started.md | Documents the toolexec drop-in workflow via GOFLAGS. |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-rep